{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19207","headline":"乐天以愚相访沽酒致欢因成七言聊以奉答 · 刘禹锡","name":"乐天以愚相访沽酒致欢因成七言聊以奉答","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"少年曾醉酒旗下，同辈黄衣颔亦黄。\n蹴踏青云寻入仕，萧条白发且飞觞。\n令徵古事欢生雅，客唤闲人兴任狂。\n犹胜独居荒草院，蝉声听尽到寒螿。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19207.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19207","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}